 ur neighborhood during emergencies. The City of Tampas Community Emergency
  Response Team (CERT) training equips residents with practical emergency p
 reparedness skills that complement the work of first responders during maj
 or emergencies and disasters. This free three-day certification course inc
 ludes hands-on instruction to teach participants basic disaster response\,
  fire suppression\, light search and rescue\, basic medical operations\, d
 isaster psychology and more. Attendance during all three (3) training days
  at the Fair Oaks Complex Community Center are required to participate. Au
 gust 14 from 6 p.m. to 9 p.m. August 15 16 from 9 a.m. to 5 p.m. This cour
