 , Florida\, Monday through Friday\, 8:00 AM to 5:00 PM (excluding City hol
 idays). The public and citizens of the City of Tampa will be able to watch
 \, listen or view this meeting: Cable TV: Spectrum Channel 640 Frontier Ch
 annel 15 Internet: https:www.tampa.govlivestream (https:www.tampa.govlives
 tream) PUBLIC COMMENT WILL BE LIMITED TO THE SUBJECT OF THE SPECIAL CALL W
