SUMMARY:Get Ready\, Stay Ready Hurricane Preparedness Event
LOCATION:724 West 109th Avenue Tampa \, FL 33612 United States
DESCRIPTION:Join us Saturday\, August 29 from 10 a.m. to noon for the Get 
 Ready - Stay Ready Hurricane Preparedness Event at the Forest Hills Park C
 ommunity Center (724 West 109th Avenue). Residents can connect with local 
 emergency management professionals\, public safety agencies\, and communit
 y organizations to learn how to prepare before\, stay safe during\, and re
 cover after a hurricane. Whether youre new to the area or a longtime resid
 ent\, this FREE event will provide valuable information and resources to h
 elp you build a safer\, more resilient household. This event is brought to
  you by the Healthy Hillsborough Collaborative  Environment Committee. \n\
 nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/194046
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/194046
