SUMMARY:Ceramics Continued Study
LOCATION:120 W Gasparilla Plaza Tampa \, FL 33602 United States
DESCRIPTION:Select Sundays  10:00 AM  1:00 PM Classes Available  913\, 920
 \, 927\, 104\, 1011\, 1018\, 118\, 1115\, 1122\, 126\, 1220 Ages 16  Begin
 ner-Intermediate Level Ceramics Continued Study is a space for students to
  enhance their learning experience with instructor assistance and guiding 
 knowledge. Sign up for a single class to continue working and add the fini
 shing touches on projects youve started in one of our other classes. Sign 
 up for multiple classes to choose your own adventure in hand-building or w
 heel thrown ceramics. Work with your instructor to plan out your projects 
