 d States
DESCRIPTION:For event details: www.humanesocietytampa.org (http:www.humane
 societytampa.org) or (813) 876-4150 This is the Humane Society Tampa Bays 
 Signature black-tie gala featuring live and silent auctions\, a cocktail h
 our with complimentary wine and beer\, dinner and dessert\, live entertain
 ment featuring adoptable pets\, after-party and cigar bar on the waterfron
 t\, and more! Gather with more than 1000 animal lovers and community leade
 rs for a beautiful evening to help us raise funds for the homeless animals
  in our care. \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/188276
