 e Saunders Planetarium (https:mosi.orgexperiencesaunders-planetarium). Ste
 p inside Americas second-largest planetarium and experience vivid laser vi
 suals\, dynamic music\, and dazzling special effects. Designed for all age
 s\, our Laser Light Shows have something for everyone. Each performance pa
 irs stunning visuals with your favorite soundtracks. You wont just watch t
